body:
Hi {{first_name}},

I hope this email finds you well! I wanted to reach out because I believe there’s a sweet opportunity for {{contact_company_name}} to enhance student engagement with something a little different – fresh mangos!

As the Founder, your role in shaping innovative strategies for student success is evident, and I think adding a tropical twist to your programs could really spark interest and excitement. Imagine incorporating mangos into healthy snacks or even team-building activities! 

If you're open to it, I'd love to chat about how we can bring this idea to life at {{contact_company_name}}. Let me know a good time for you, or feel free to drop me a line at {{contact_email}}.

Looking forward to hearing from you!

Best,  
{{sender_full_name}}  
{{sender_first_name}}  
{{sender_company_name}}
